{"ticker":"STZ","updated":"2026-10-30T23:14:22Z","profile":{"longName":"Constellation Brands, Inc.","shortName":"Constellation Brands, Inc.","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Beverages - Brewers","country":"United States","website":"https://www.cbrands.com","fullTimeEmployees":9400,"marketCap":22901114880,"trailingPE":12.115488,"forwardPE":11.194197,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":2.4868999,"pegRatio":1.66,"targetMeanPrice":150.86957,"targetHighPrice":209.0,"targetLowPrice":99.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":23,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.061,"earningsGrowth":0.253,"grossMargins":0.52771,"operatingMargins":0.33578,"profitMargins":0.20895,"totalRevenue":9208699904,"beta":0.429,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":168.6,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":110.6,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":3.16},"summary":"Constellation Brands, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, produces, imports, markets, and sells beer, wine, and spirits in the United States, Canada, Mexico, New Zealand, and Italy. It offers beer under the Corona Extra, Corona Familiar, Corona Sunbrew, Corona Light, Corona Non-Alcoholic, Corona Premier, Modelo Especial, Modelo Chelada, Modelo Negra, Modelo Spiked Aguas Frescas, Modelo Oro, Modelo Noche Especial, Victoria, Vicky Chamoy, and Pacifico brand names. The company also offers wine under the Sea Smoke, Schrader Cellars, Kim Crawford, Mount Veeder, Ruffino, My Favorite Neighbor, Robert Mondavi Winery, and The Prisoner Wine Company brand names; and spirits under the Casa Noble, High West, Mi CAMPO, and Nelson's Green Brier brand names. Additionally, it offers a spirit-based, ready-to-drink alcoholic beverage under the SpikedAde brand. It provides its products to wholesale distributors, retailers, and state alcohol beverage control agencies. Constellation Brands, Inc. was founded in 1945 and is headquartered in Rochester, New York.","summary_zh":"Constellation Brands, Inc. 及其子公司在美國、加拿大、墨西哥、紐西蘭和義大利生產、進口、行銷和銷售啤酒、葡萄酒和烈酒。它提供 Corona Extra、Corona Familiar、Corona Sunbrew、Corona Light、Corona Non-Alcoholic、Corona Premier、Modelo Especial、Modelo Chelada、Modelo Negra、Modelo Spiked Aguas Frescas、Modelo Oro、Modelo Noche Especial、Victoria、Vicky Chamoy 和 Pacifico 品牌的啤酒。該公司還提供 Sea Smoke、Schrader Cellars、Kim Crawford、Mount Veeder、Ruffino、My Favourite Neighbor、Robert Mondavi Winery 和 The Prisoner Wine Company 品牌的葡萄酒；以及 Casa Noble、High West、Mi CAMPO 和 Nelson's Green Brier 品牌的烈酒。此外，該公司還提供 SpikedAde 品牌的烈酒即飲酒精飲料。它向批發分銷商、零售商和國家酒精飲料控制機構提供產品。 Constellation Brands, Inc. 成立於 1945 年，總部位於紐約州羅徹斯特。","sector_zh":"消費者防禦","industry_zh":"飲料 - 啤酒廠","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":150.13,"h":154.16,"l":149.36,"c":151.26,"v":6085100},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":150.25,"h":150.57,"l":146.32,"c":146.49,"v":4546300},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":146.87,"h":147.8,"l":144.81,"c":145.88,"v":2758200},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":146.23,"h":150.73,"l":145.53,"c":148.43,"v":3046600},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":148.22,"h":148.22,"l":144.58,"c":146.1,"v":3096700},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":146.0,"h":148.1,"l":145.38,"c":145.98,"v":3328900},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":146.0,"h":146.0,"l":142.51,"c":142.9,"v":2236200},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":142.9,"h":143.91,"l":142.25,"c":142.98,"v":3037700},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":143.0,"h":143.0,"l":139.45,"c":139.49,"v":2446800},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":140.23,"h":140.54,"l":135.25,"c":135.42,"v":3475800},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":135.67,"h":135.71,"l":133.84,"c":134.68,"v":2904400},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":135.13,"h":135.99,"l":132.82,"c":133.04,"v":2754700},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":133.1,"h":134.2,"l":131.9,"c":133.02,"v":2951800},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":133.76,"h":134.15,"l":131.82,"c":132.92,"v":6144600},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":133.0,"h":135.18,"l":132.49,"c":133.48,"v":3275300},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":134.37,"h":134.64,"l":131.2,"c":131.78,"v":3051300},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":131.76,"h":134.48,"l":131.5,"c":133.39,"v":2590100},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":133.75,"h":133.93,"l":131.86,"c":132.65,"v":2518300},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":132.99,"h":133.22,"l":131.61,"c":132.49,"v