oducer and marketer of beer, wine, and spirits with operations in the U.S., Mexico, New Zealand, and Italy with powerful, consumer-connected, high-quality brands like Modelo Especial, Corona Extra, Pacifico, Victoria, Kim Crawford, Ruffino, The Prisoner Wine Company, Robert Mondavi Winery, Mi CAMPO, and High West. In the U.S., we are one of the top dollar share gainers among beverage alcohol suppliers. We are also the second-largest beer company and have the #1 beer brand, Modelo Especial, in dollar sales in the U.S. We continued to strengthen our leadership position in the U.S. beer market as the #1 dollar share gainer in the overall U.S. beer market, and the #2 dollar share gainer in the high-end. Within wine and spirits, we have implemented a multi-year strategy that repositioned this business to a portfolio of exclusively higher-end brands that we believe is","zh":"我們是一家啤酒、葡萄酒和烈酒的國際生產商和行銷商，業務遍及美國、墨西哥、紐西蘭和義大利，擁有強大的、與消費者緊密相連的高品質品牌，如 Modelo Especial、Corona Extra、Pacifico、Victoria、Kim Crawford、Ruffino、The Prisoner Wine Company、Robert Mondavi Winery、Victoria、Kim Crawford、Ruffino、The Prisoner Wine Company、Robert Mondavi Winery、MiMi CAM 和 High West。在美國，我們是飲料酒精供應商中美元份額漲幅最大的公司之一。我們也是第二大啤酒公司，擁有全美銷售額第一的啤酒品牌 Modelo Especial。我們繼續鞏固我們在美國啤酒市場的領導地位，成為美國整體啤酒市場第一大美元份額增長者和高端啤酒市場第二大美元份額增長者。在葡萄酒和烈酒領域，我們實施了一項多年策略，將該業務重新定位為一系列獨家高端品牌，我們認為這些品牌是"},{"en":"Our mission is to build brands that people love because we believe elevating human connections is Worth Reaching For. It is worth our dedication, hard work, and calculated risks to anticipate market trends and deliver more for our consumers, stockholders, employees, and industry.","zh":"我們的使命是打造人們喜愛的品牌，因為我們相信提升人際關係是值得追求的。預測市場趨勢並為我們的消費者、股東、員工和行業提供更多服務是值得我們奉獻、辛勤工作和計算風險的。"},{"en":"Our overall strategic vision is to consistently deliver industry-leading total stockholder returns over the long-term through a focus on these key pillars:","zh":"我們的整體策略願景是透過專注於以下關鍵支柱，長期持續提供業界領先的股東總回報："}],"markets":[{"en":"We report our operating results in three segments: (i) Beer, (ii) Wine and Spirits, and (iii) Corporate Operations and Other. The business segments reflect how our operations are managed, how resources are allocated, how operating performance is evaluated by senior management, and the structure of our internal financial reporting.","zh":"我們報告三個部門的經營績效：（i）啤酒，（ii）葡萄酒和烈酒，以及（iii）企業運營及其他。業務分部反映了我們的營運管理方式、資源配置方式、高階管理層如何評估經營績效以及內部財務報告的結構。"},{"en":"We are the #1 brewer and seller of imported beer in the U.S. market. We are also a leader in the high-end segment of the U.S. beer market, which includes the imported and ABA categories. We have the exclusive right to import, market, and sell our beer brands in all 50 states of the U.S., which include the following:","zh":"我們是美國市場排名第一的進口啤酒釀造商和銷售商。我們也是美國啤酒市場高端市場的領導者，其中包括進口啤酒和 ABA 啤酒類別。我們擁有在美國所有 50 個州進口、行銷和銷售我們的啤酒品牌的獨家權利，其中包括："}],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"The beverage alcohol industry is highly competitive. We compete on the basis of quality, price, brand recognition and reputation, and distribution strength. Our products compete with other alcoholic and non-alcoholic beverages for consumer purchases, as well as shelf space in retail stores, restaurant presence, and wholesaler attention. We compete with numerous multinational producers and distributors of beverage alcohol products, some of which have greater resources than we do. Our principal competitors include:","zh":"飲料酒產業競爭激烈。我們在品質、價格、品牌認知度和聲譽以及分銷實力的基礎上競爭。我們的產品與其他酒精和非酒精飲料在消費者購買、零售店貨架空間、餐廳存在和批發商關注方面競爭。我們與眾多飲料酒精產品的跨國生產商和分銷商競爭，其中一些比我們擁有更多的資源。我們的主要競爭對手包括："},{"en":"WineDeutsch Family Wine & Spirits, Duckhorn Portfolio, GALLO, Treasury Wine Estates, The Wine Group, Wagner Family of Wine","zh":"WineDeutsch Family Wine & Spirits、Duckhorn Portfolio、GALLO、Treasury Wine Estates、The Wine Group、Wagner Family of Wine"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2026-02-28","items":[{"name":"Beer","val":8315200000.000001,"zh":"啤酒"},{"name":"Constellation Wines & Spirits","val":823800000,"zh":"星座葡萄酒及烈酒"}],"total":9755500000}},"peers":["TAP","DEO","EL","CLX","ULTA"]}}